{"type":"message","id":"caed3598","parentId":"a51098e5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T20:45:30.742Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both returned error 1101 (CF_RANDOM_BYTES_DEV_IS_NOT_SET). This seems like a Cloudflare Workers error related to missing configuration (random bytes not seeded). The POST is failing at the server level due to a server-side issue.\n\nThis is not an authentication issue (that's a different error), it's a server-side error. I should report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 20:45 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n### 响应行动\n\n- ✅ 读取并分析了两线程最近5条消息\n- ⚠️ **POST /send 失败** — 服务器返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers 随机数种子未配置错误），这是**服务端问题**，与 API Key 无关\n\n### 服务器错误\n\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n这是 Cloudflare Workers 的 `CF_RANDOM_BYTES_DEV_IS_NOT_SET` 错误，表明 Workers 运行时环境的随机数生成器未正确初始化。通常是：\n\n1. Workers 运行时配置问题\n2. 服务端依赖缺失或初始化失败\n\n### 结论\n\n- 双线程无新人类讨论，无需主动回应 ✅\n- 心跳无法发送（服务端故障）⚠️\n- 建议检查 Worker 实例或重新部署服务"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":618,"output":313,"cacheRead":16704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17635,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779396326230,"responseId":"chatcmpl-df16efc2-60b0-4ad2-abdc-c440f0154106"}}
